            "initialStreaming": "Criterion",
            "tmdb_id": 837,
            "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqqkiZSU9EBGZ1KiDmfn07S7qvv.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Rabid's influence on viral outbreak narratives can be traced through films like <a href=\"/movie/170\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"170\">28 Days Later</a> (2002) and <a href=\"/movie/23963\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"23963\">Pontypool</a> (2008). The film's combination of sexual transmission and viral spread particularly resonated during the AIDS crisis, influencing allegorical horror films like <a href=\"/movie/1091\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"1091\">The Thing</a> (1982) and later works like <a href=\"/movie/270303\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"270303\">It Follows</a> (2014)."
      }
